=== FINAL INTERPRETATION ===
1. Was the original 50-iteration GMM converged? Diagonal family converged=True after 101 iterations (rel_tol=1e-05).
2. See likelihood_vs_dime_nll_*.png and checkpoint_curve in results JSON — compare whether controller_train_nll keeps improving after log-likelihood plateaus.
3. See counterfactual_decomposition — compare frac_assignment_changed_vs_previous_model across model0->model1->model2->model3 to see which step moves the most points / NLL.
4. Global assignment agreement with k-means (diagonal): 17.7%  ARI=0.1162
5. See margin_percentile_disagreement_curve.png — check whether disagreement fraction rises monotonically toward the lowest-margin band.
6. H(Y|C): k-means=3.2102 vs GMM-hard=2.6484 (lower is more informative clusters).
7. See multi_seed_stability — log_likelihood_vs_nll_correlation=-0.7551, highest_likelihood_seed_is_best_nll_seed=True
8. See point 7 — same correlation number answers this directly.
9. See final_summary_table for the complexity/performance tradeoff across all 4 families.
10. Judge from the combination of all of the above — see final_summary_table's validation_nll column for the headline comparison.

